{"ticker":{"symbol":"263810.KQ","name":"상신전자","market":"KR","exchange":""},"currency":"KRW","price":2725.0,"change_pct":-0.003656307129798919,"market_cap":43385253888.0,"pe":null,"pb":null,"dividend_yield":null,"week52_low":0.0,"week52_high":3790.0,"sector":"Technology","industry":"Electronic Components","country":"South Korea","city":"Gimhae-si","employees":116,"website":"https://www.sangshin-e.com","business_summary":"Sangshin Electronics Co., Ltd. manufactures and sells electrical and electronic parts in South Korea. The company offers noise filters that are used in white household appliances, such as washing machines, air conditioners, refrigerators, dryers, stylers, microwaves, cleaners, and water purifiers; and reactors are used in energy-saving white goods, solar power, ESS, self-regenerative braking devices, and electric vehicles. It also provides coils for use in electrical appliances, including rice cookers, electric ranges, air cleaners, power supply devices, etc. Sangshin Electronics Co., Ltd. was founded in 1988 and is headquartered in Gimhae-si, South Korea.","business_summary_ko":"상신전자주식회사는 한국에서 전기, 전자 부품을 제조 및 판매하는 회사입니다. 이 회사는 세탁기, 에어컨, 냉장고, 건조기, 스타일러, 전자레인지, 청소기, 정수기 등 백색 가전제품에 사용되는 노이즈 필터를 제공합니다. 에너지절약형 백색가전, 태양광발전, ESS, 자가회생제동장치, 전기차 등에 원자로가 사용됩니다. 또한 밥솥, 전기레인지, 공기청정기, 전원 공급 장치 등을 포함한 전기 제품에 사용되는 코일을 제공합니다. 상신전자주식회사는 1988년에 설립되었으며 대한민국 김해시에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","desc_ko":"","estimates":[{"period":"2026","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null},{"period":"2027","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null}],"ltg":null,"calendar":{},"industry_ko":"전자부품","financials":[{"period":"2022","revenue":111344599950.0,"operating_income":840928570.0,"net_income":1124700870.0,"eps":79.0},{"period":"2023","revenue":109703758730.0,"operating_income":1544294690.0,"net_income":2238253310.0,"eps":157.0},{"period":"2024","revenue":124971626610.0,"operating_income":2128294920.0,"net_income":2405392790.0,"eps":169.0},{"period":"2025","revenue":129139555830.0,"op